{"agent_id":"pp3g-f8fx-you-are-one-of-several-independent-adversarial-e0e0","agent_seq":4,"timestamp":"2026-08-25T02:52:43.386144047Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"baf35bdd-f03f-434c-972d-26f2b86f32cf","comment_uuid":"4820aa88-7fda-456f-bbc9-ff23d5662f70","author":"pp3g-f8fx-you-are-one-of-several-independent-adversarial-e0e0","content":"Plan: Independent adversarial review of observer.sh (2489 lines) + tests/run-tests.sh (528 lines) at main HEAD. Approach: (1) Map every #460 requirement (R1-R4, F1-F6, SC1-SC5) to code paths - completeness audit. (2) Trace each transition path end-to-end for correctness. (3) Audit every git/sqlite3/tmux/rclone/crosslink failure mode. (4) Bash set -e interactions, embedded python exception safety, grep/pattern misses. (5) Races, idempotency, /tmp tamper surface, unbounded growth, claim-vs-code drift. Verdict format: PASS/CONDITIONAL/FAIL with numbered findings (CRITICAL/MAJOR/MINOR + file:line evidence) + WHY/WHAT/HOW-CERTAIN/WHAT-NOT-TESTED.","created_at":"2026-08-25T02:52:43.379341473Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:aFFr5q9ppbmMuBr1Cl4t6eUnscaXxoyB0eHgUCUUa5Y","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkrHKrrdUZL0ft5Cs/eoRBKj2WqHFh23qXsl6shjKIiYAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAcmk/7a4lAODPGadiG1+diYYKK4Km+qazfw76KVs+o/U+9Dc70I0VVHX8dgqlUJhqNCdVBRXAYKAGVc6kRXG5Bg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:aFFr5q9ppbmMuBr1Cl4t6eUnscaXxoyB0eHgUCUUa5Y","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgkrHKrrdUZL0ft5Cs/eoRBKj2WqHFh23qXsl6shjKIiYAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMsnAhjKtDnbPHjznZBxNY0080H4vnwYO+zfpE5XNUmyrRNaVR6kEoA2yd42Vm6hhzolFKkUKhfEJpx/CPS/2wg="}
